Z||000001||Rick 88||10-17-2001||01:06 AM||||Pontiac offered white 16 in crosslace wheels on the Trans Am during the late 80's. It looks really good but will be a bear to keep clean. You might want to color match your aero package as well. What kind of paint did you use on your side moulding?<P>Rick 88||||reg||1
